The source split is now pinned down: Moh’s p.209 supplies extra realization data for `(99,66)`—a radius-2 general point—so its Prop. 6.3 bound fails. That datum is not in the skeleton and has no analogue stated for the `D=108` row; I’m keeping the latter conditional rather than importing the cubic casework.
