   309	48<=D<=200 POLY+ODE       1420 rows / 686 groups
   310	u_s>1                       310 rows / 177 groups
   311	ODE u_s>1                   310 rows / 177 groups
   312	ODE and POLY+ODE u_s>1 row and group key sets: identical
   313	```
   314	
   315	At the top, condition (7) and `M_s=n-2` imply
   316	`v_s>d_s/(n-M_s)=d_s/2`.  Therefore
   317	`u_s=d_s-v_s<d_s/2` and `v_s/u_s>1`.  Prop.6.1's floor 1 consequently proves
   318	the Prop.6.3 bound for none of these skeletons.  The full measured threshold
   319	range is `4/3` through `9/2`; the exact outcome of the skeleton procedure is
