   333	
   334	## 7. Bounded OPENs and cheapest tests
   335	
   336	| typed OPEN | bounded quantity | cheapest fail-closed test |
   337	|---|---|---|
   338	| `OPEN[99-LINEAR-10]` | Moh's stated 10-variable linear-power coefficient system, presently not displayed | reconstruct the p.208--209 approximate-root ansatz for `(27,18,21,8)` and solve it with explicit ring map, vanished-leader branches, and positive/negative controls |
