   340	| `OPEN[MINOR-RADIUS-108]` | one actual rational `delta_2^*`, its common Puiseux jet, and the leading `g,T_i` polynomials | compute first pairwise contacts in the actual minor cluster; compare once with `7/2`; do not compute a major radius again |
   341	| `OPEN[108-A]` | the one-root leading profile plus all `T_i` profiles at the measured subcritical radius | test whether the combined-disc split is carried by a `T_i`; derive the case-specific transform and coefficient equations; no generic Prop.6.4 step |
   342	| `OPEN[108-B]` | the two-root quadratic profile (`12+12`) plus its two subdisc jets | normalize the two roots, construct the transform at the measured radius, and solve the resulting monomial-Jacobian coefficient system; use the radius-3 `Omega` only if `delta^*=3` |
   343	| `OPEN[177-MINOR-DATA]` | at most 177 actual radii and, for each subcritical result, one finite leading-factor partition; 4 radii in the `D<=120` pilot | batch the same first-contact computation group by group, beginning with 108; a skeleton-only rerun cannot improve 0/177 |
   344	
   345	This work queue does not assert realization: a DP survivor is not a
   346	`FULL_ACTUAL_EXIT`.
   347	
   348	## 8. Reproduction, typing, and `FALLACY-v2`
   349	
   350	Drivers and page images are in `box/minordich-20260903/`:
   351	
