   366	
   367	Both drivers exited zero; the census took 18.12 seconds and 150396 KiB RSS.
   368	No ledger, `jc2-lean`, or `ideation-*` file was edited.
   369	
   370	```text
   371	SOURCE-READ       Moh pp.147,168-169,179,190-199,202,207-211.
   372	SOURCE-INFERRED   p.209's D_2^* general point gives the (99,66) minor radius 2.
   373	EXACT-ARITHMETIC  gcd towers, Def.5.1 major radii, thresholds, orders, degrees.
   374	PROVED-HERE       only the explicitly conditional D=108 radius-3 coordinate algebra.
   375	MEASURED          charged POLY+ODE counts, group lists, threshold distribution.
   376	OPEN              all six bounded residues in §7; no branch is promoted to a kill.
