   378	
   379	The audit keeps the combined minor disc separate from `g`'s leading-root
   380	profile, and keeps all unstarred major radii separate from `delta^*`.  It uses
   381	no pole identity, no floor-as-attainment step, no raw remainder, and no
   382	unverified variable map.  It makes no exit-price assertion, so the required
   383	`charge_basis` line is not triggered.

