+MEASURED          charged POLY+ODE counts, group lists, threshold distribution.
+OPEN              all six bounded residues in §7; no branch is promoted to a kill.
+```
+
+The audit keeps the combined minor disc separate from `g`'s leading-root
+profile, and keeps all unstarred major radii separate from `delta^*`.  It uses
+no pole identity, no floor-as-attainment step, no raw remainder, and no
+unverified variable map.  It makes no exit-price assertion, so the required
+`charge_basis` line is not triggered.

