|---|---|---|
| `OPEN[MINOR-RADIUS-99]` | one combined `delta_2^*` and its first-separation witness (needed in the linear branch) | compute pairwise first contacts among the selected `g,T_1^psi,T_2^psi` roots; compare once with `8/3`; do not identify the p.209 `g` probe with the boundary |
