+Both drivers exited zero; the census took 18.12 seconds and 150396 KiB RSS.
+No ledger, `jc2-lean`, or `ideation-*` file was edited.
+
+```text
+SOURCE-READ       Moh pp.147,150-152,161,168-171,179,190-199,202,207-211.
+SOURCE-ASSERTED   p.209's two alternatives, including omission of cubic 1+1+1.
+SOURCE-DERIVED    common-base degrees from p.150, p.152, Def.3.1, and Prop.6.1.
+EXACT-ARITHMETIC  gcd towers, Def.5.1 major radii, thresholds, orders, degrees.
