+| `OPEN[99-DICHOTOMY-EXHAUSTIVE]` | one missing exclusion of a three-distinct-root cubic | either check every Prop.4.5/4.6 hypothesis after an explicit local re-gauging, or retain a third `1+1+1` branch |
