+| `(120,80)` | `(-80,-60,-10,25,118)` | `(120,40,20,10,5,1)` | `(1,1,6,3)` | `2`; `3/2` | `(11/16,19/28,51/77,37/56,-1)` | `OPEN[MINOR-RADIUS]` |
