+| `OPEN[177-MINOR-DATA]` | 177 group questions represented by 310 row/paths (worst case: 310 contact computations); 4/4 in the `D<=120` pilot | batch the same first-contact test, sharing results only when proved; a skeleton-only rerun cannot improve 0/177 |
