+- `client_arithmetic.py` checks the exact gcd towers, Definition 5.1 major
+  radii, thresholds, and typed conditional detector profiles for `(99,66)`
+  and `(108,72)`.
+- `pages/` contains 200-dpi PNG renderings made with `pdftoppm`.  Printed
